  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1002.32 Grease interceptor",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1002.32 “Grease interceptor” means a tank or series of tanks into which wastewater that contains grease is discharged, including but not limited to gravity grease interceptors, hydromechanical grease interceptors, and other technologies, previously called a “grease trap”.\n\nSource. #14486, eff 2-1-26, EXPIRES: 2-1-36",
